hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15824","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us: Shubah narrated to us, from Abu al-Fayd, he said: I heard Abdullah ibn Murrah narrating from Abu Said al-Zuraqi, that a man from Ashja asked the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, about coitus interruptus. He said: My wife is nursing. The Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Whatever is decreed in the womb will be."
